%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0a3e05ac99e285f46a346cc951bb5545, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Tutorial.TutorialDatabase
  Entries:
  - Id: 0
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Welcome!
    Body: Dig down, get rich. Mine ore and sell it at the Depot for Coins, spend
      Coins at the Market on upgrades and automation, and keep an eye out for rare
      Artifacts.
  - Id: 1
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Storage Depot
    Body: 'Deposit the ore you''re carrying here, then sell it. Ores stored here can
      also be used in the Processing Center to trade time for extra money! Just being
      near the Depot refuels and repairs you for free, automatically - no need to
      buy anything.'
  - Id: 2
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Market
    Body: Spend money here on upgrades. These upgrades are lost in a Resonance.
  - Id: 3
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Museum
    Body: Spend the Artifacts you've found here on permanent Attunements that
      carry across Digs. They queue up and only take effect at your next Resonance.
  - Id: 4
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Processing Center
    Body: Combine raw ore into finished goods worth more than the raw materials.
      Finished goods show up back at the Depot, ready to sell. Utilizes ores stored
      in the Depot.
  - Id: 5
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Control Center
    Body: 'Monitor your automatons and drones and adjust their settings
      here. Refueling and repairs happen for free at the Depot.'
  - Id: 6
    DisplayType: 2
    Title: Museum
    Body: The Museum is where you spend Artifacts on permanent Attunements. They queue
      up and only take effect once you begin a Resonance, which collapses the mine and
      resets your money and upgrades - but your next Dig will be faster!
  - Id: 7
    DisplayType: 2
    Title: Processing Center
    Body: The Processing Center turns raw ore into refined goods worth more than
      the raw ore. Finished goods go to the Depot, where you can sell them.
  - Id: 8
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Low Fuel
    Body: 'Your jetpack burns fuel, and you use a little even while standing still.
      Head back up to the Depot: being near it refuels and repairs you automatically,
      for free. If your tank runs dry, you''ll black out and respawn at the surface.'
  - Id: 9
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Inventory Full
    Body: Your storage is full, so you can't pick up any more ore. Bring it back
      to the Depot to store/sell it, or buy a bigger inventory at the Market.
  - Id: 10
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Lost Ore Chest
    Body: When you die, some of the ore you were carrying (at least half) stays
      behind in a chest where you fell. Dig back down to it and pick it up to get
      that ore back.
  - Id: 11
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Deeper Layers
    Body: 'Deeper layers have richer ore, but the dirt is harder to dig. Hazards
      show up from here on: explosive blocks, falling rocks, gas pockets and lava.
      Watch your health!'
  - Id: 12
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Mining Automatons
    Body: Your automaton digs through the mine on its own and brings full loads of
      ore back to the Depot. It needs fuel too! Check their earnings from the Control
      Center.
  - Id: 13
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Storage Drones
    Body: Storage Drones fly out, take ore from you or your automatons, and bring
      it back to the Depot. You can pick who they collect from at the Control Center.
  - Id: 14
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Fuel Drones
    Body: Fuel Drones deliver fuel to you and your automatons. With one around, an
      empty tank leaves you stranded instead of knocked out. Wait for a drone, or
      use the respawn prompt to head back to the surface.
  - Id: 15
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Aftershocks
    Body: Pick one Aftershock for your next Dig. Blessings are pure upside. Gambles
      give a bigger bonus but come with a drawback. Contracts pay out Artifacts when
      you deliver enough of one ore.
  - Id: 16
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: A New Dig
    Body: The Resonance has reshaped the mine and reset your money and Market upgrades.
      You keep your Artifacts and Attunements, which now take effect. Check the HUD
      for your Aftershock and its contract progress.
  - Id: 17
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Critter Caught!
    Body: You caught a critter! Find the Critter Shop in a cave somewhere in the
      upper layers and turn your critters in there for rewards!
  - Id: 18
    DisplayType: 2
    Title: Control Center
    Body: The Control Center is where you monitor your automatons and drones. Check
      their earnings and adjust their settings here.
